@startuml
participant "Vehicle Simulator" as Simulator
participant "Telemetry Gateway" as Gateway
participant Kafka
participant "Telemetry Processor" as Processor
database PostgreSQL
database Redis
queue "telemetry.rejected.v1" as Rejected

Simulator -> Gateway : length + JSON payload
Gateway -> Gateway : framing e validazione tecnica
Gateway -> Kafka : telemetry.raw.v1(key=vehicleId)
alt conferma osservata entro budget handler (default 5s)
    Kafka --> Gateway : producer acknowledgement
    Gateway --> Simulator : ACCEPTED (pubblicazione Kafka)
else errore o budget esaurito
    Gateway --> Simulator : REJECTED / UPSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE
    note over Simulator, Kafka
        Possibile consegna tardiva anche dopo NACK.
        Retry con stesso payload e messageId; deduplicazione sample/alert.
    end note
end
Kafka -> Processor : telemetry event
Processor -> PostgreSQL : lookup vehicle
alt vehicle ACTIVE
    Processor -> PostgreSQL : insert sample e alert
    PostgreSQL --> Processor : commit
    Processor -> Redis : update latest state
else vehicle UNKNOWN o DISABLED
    Processor -> Rejected : rejection event
    Processor -> Processor : log e metrica per reason
end
@enduml
